      <title>中国制造业PMI连续两月收缩 幅度小于预期仍存压力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E4%B8%9APMI%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E4%B8%A4%E6%9C%88%E6%94%B6%E7%BC%A9-%E5%B9%85%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%8E%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</link>
